1. Cancellation Backfill for Small Clinics ⭐ top pick
Who has the problem: Dental and physio clinic front desks, and the patients waiting weeks for an appointment.
The problem: When someone cancels, the slot goes empty because calling around the waitlist takes too long. The clinic loses revenue while patients who would have taken the slot keep waiting.
The build: Tables for appointments and the waitlist. Cancelling a slot ranks the waitlist by urgency, availability and distance, then offers the slot to the top match, who can accept with one click.
Demo hook: “A 3pm slot just opened” leads to “filled in 30 seconds.” It’s simple, it involves real money and everyone has lived it.
 
